---
layout: base.njk
title: Guestbook
permalink: /guestbook/
---
{#- The book. Entries come from src/_data/guestbook.js (live from the VPS at
    build, snapshot as fallback). The form posts to the VPS service directly —
    no JS here — and lands on /guestbook/thanks/. Entries are pending until
    approved from ntfy, so nothing signed shows up until it's been read. -#}
<h1>Guestbook</h1>

{#- The invitation is Hat's, written in the vault's site.yaml (`guestbook:`,
    carried by publish.py like `intro:`). Line breaks in the yaml block
    survive as their own spans, same as the home intro. -#}
{% if site.guestbook %}<p class="links-lede">{% for line in site.guestbook.split("\n") %}<span>{{ line }}</span>{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
<p class="gb-note">Entries show up once I've read them.</p>

<form class="guestbook-form" method="post" action="https://sign.chaosh.at/sign">
  <label>name
    <input name="name" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="nickname">
  </label>
  <label>website <span class="gb-opt">(optional)</span>
    <input name="website" maxlength="200" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" placeholder="example.com">
  </label>
  <label>message
    <textarea name="message" maxlength="500" rows="4" required></textarea>
  </label>
  {#- Honeypot. Hidden from people, filled by bots; the service drops it. -#}
  <div class="gb-trap" aria-hidden="true">
    <label>email <input name="email" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
  </div>
  <button type="submit">sign</button>
</form>

{% if guestbook.entries.length %}
<h2 class="links-head">{{ guestbook.entries.length }} {% if guestbook.entries.length == 1 %}signature{% else %}signatures{% endif %}</h2>
<ol class="guestbook-list" reversed>
  {% for e in guestbook.entries %}
  <li class="gb-entry">
    <p class="gb-meta">
      <span class="gb-name">{% if e.website %}<a href="{{ e.website }}" rel="nofollow noopener ugc">{{ e.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.name }}{% endif %}</span>
      <time datetime="{{ e.date | dateSlug }}">{{ e.date | readableDate }}</time>
    </p>
    <p class="gb-message">{{ e.message }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
{% else %}
<p class="gb-empty">Nobody has signed yet.</p>
{% endif %}
